    <string key="page.alt">Driving through Johannesburg</string>
    <string key="page.blurb">From the Carlton Centre over the Mandela Bridge, up the M1 under the jacarandas to Sandton, then down to Soweto past the painted Orlando Towers, Soccer City and the mine dumps. South Africa drives on the left.</string>
    <string key="page.T_MAPNOTE">The road roughly follows real places in Johannesburg. South Africa drives on the left, so the slow lane is on the left. The horn makes the car ahead move over.</string>
    <string key="page.T_R1S">Pick a trip between Joburg landmarks, from the Carlton Centre to Sandton to Soweto, and reach the end.</string>
    <string key="page.T_R3S">Cameras flash above 110 km/h, and crashes damage the car.</string>
